<item><title>Mauritania sets border priorities in West African migration process</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/mauritania-sets-border-priorities-in-west-african-migration-3e2d5c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/mauritania-sets-border-priorities-in-west-african-migration-3e2d5c/</guid><category>Mauritania</category><description>At a Dakar conference, the foreign ministry’s secretary-general called for regional cooperation and outlined controls on migration data and document fraud.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 12:38:41 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mr.jpg" length="34560" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mr.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
